<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria to revalue naira to 83.5 per dlr - c.bank.</title>
<headline>Nigeria to revalue naira to 83.5 per dlr - c.bank.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's naira currency is to be revalued to 83.5 naira to the dollar from 84.0 naira at this week's foreign currency auction, a central bank official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is part of a continuing process,&quot; a central bank official contacted in the capital Abuja told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>This week's auction to banks will take place on Thursday, instead of the usual Wednesday, because of a Moslem public holiday, the official said.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
